WEBVTT

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:22.250
It's time for a ride!

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:34.590
Director Samu Kang

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:03.908
Come on, stay there!

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.920
Come on, let's go. Who is it?

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.400
And don't spend any more money here.

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:06.900
What's wrong with your wife?

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:09.100
Last night I didn't sleep at all.

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:10.000
She's so shy.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:14.230
I had no choice. My girlfriend didn't want to let me go.

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:16.830
She was afraid to kill herself if I stayed with her.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:17.670
Do you understand?

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:20.250
You shouldn't have a girlfriend at all.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.210
You're married.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:23.570
I know, but we Italians are made for love.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.860
We need to be in love forever.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.900
Just like the Chinese to work.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:29.860
It's all a matter of psyche.

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:32.540
We're not that impulsive in love.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:35.200
Come on, we're late for work.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.480
If I get out of here, she'll kill me.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.940
Come on, let's get out.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:41.920
No, I won't be surprised to kill you too.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:43.800
Come on, I'll get out through the balcony.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:44.480
Are you coming?

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:47.130
What? Did you forget about the Spaniard downstairs?

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:48.490
No, I'll be the first.

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:53.860
Come on, I'm getting out.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:02.170
Hola!

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:04.840
Good morning.

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:13.830
Oh, I'm getting sick.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.050
You Chinese, don't you use poles?

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.860
The Italians are hitting the pole again.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:19.640
Come on, let's go.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:21.820
Don't you think it's clean?

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.140
I made you a sign not to jump.

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:24.580
Why didn't you warn me?

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.220
I was going to do it. At least I screamed.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:27.960
But jump before I succeed.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:40.030
Excuse me, how do I get to Via Leitana?

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:48.240
One moment. Where is Via Leitana?

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:54.760
Drive right and turn left in the first direction.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:58.340
When you get to Mallorca Square...

00:04:58.340 --> 00:04:58.540
What?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.310
You've lost your way, because you've missed the Bilbao boulevard.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.690
So what do I do?

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:07.250
Turn left on Bilbao and you'll see a fountain.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:08.390
Make sure it works.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:09.750
And if it does?

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:12.050
Then Via Leitana is right in front of you.

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.210
And if it doesn't work?

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:18.040
The municipality has closed the street for repairs and will have to find a suitable route.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:20.220
Now I understand. Thank you very much.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:31.690
Hello.

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:50.970
Hello. I'm very sorry.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:55.490
I'm sorry. It wasn't on purpose, sir. My car...

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.640
I'll help you now, Mr. Policeman. Excuse us.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.220
I'm very sorry.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.330
I haven't seen you around.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:06.350
Are you deaf? Get out!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.450
It won't happen again, Mr. Policeman. I promise.

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:16.280
Good morning, sir.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:17.140
Good morning.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:18.560
Did you clean the chimney?

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.980
Not at all.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.700
Then what's on your face?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:25.090
Damn you, Chinese!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:59.980
Thank you.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.640
Henry Mudd is a private detective.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.100
Oh, boss.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:25.940
What are you doing, man?

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.800
Nothing. I was just practicing.

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:41.530
Why haven't you changed the mug yet?

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.370
They came from Energo and they sent it to us, boss.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:49.460
The company has to pay me a lot of money, and they're acting like I'm their debtor.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.560
You haven't paid me in three months.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.400
No one works without money, boss.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.040
But I left you at work, didn't I?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.140
If it wasn't for me, who would hire you?

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.560
And as you well know, there's no work.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:00.460
There is no Spain.

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:01.460
You're right.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.840
But I can't pay your bills.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:05.800
Now you speak like a good listener.

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.280
Someone must have been looking for me.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.640
From the telephone company.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.790
They almost want to hire me.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:15.690
They came to unplug the cables on the phones.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.320
It's no wonder it's so quiet here.

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:22.350
Besides, Alfonso is looking for you.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.160
Alone?

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:24.620
No, with two gorillas.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:26.530
What did he want?

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.930
He said you owe him 10,000 peseti.

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.580
Oh, this is a encrypted message. Don't worry.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:36.060
So there are new tracks.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:38.180
Besides that, ask her when you're coming back.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.590
The other time tell her I'm from outside the city.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:45.180
This is also a encrypted message.

00:08:45.740 --> 00:08:46.980
Wait, tell her personally.

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:47.890
How so?

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.020
Tell her I'm coming back for lunch.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.180
It's almost lunch.

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:53.950
What? Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:55.610
But what the hell happened?

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:59.530
Another coded message. My life is in danger.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:08:59.710
Thank you!

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:06.380
From now on, I appoint you as the director of the agency.

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:08.480
You will be responsible for everything until I'm gone.

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:09.330
Is that clear?

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:12.920
That means a raise.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:14.060
What about the payment?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:17.940
Don't lie to yourself.

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:22.970
The executive director is still a director.

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:26.050
I need a doorbell.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:32.030
Tell her to sit down.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:34.570
Take a breath before you start.

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:36.850
I have to tell you that I have principles.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:40.380
I don't agree with anything illegal.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:42.340
I'm telling you honestly.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:43.470
I just don't like it.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.370
And now, tell me. What's the problem?

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:48.670
I want you to find a man.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.300
For me, this is something new.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:51.900
Haven't you done it before?

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:57.000
I wanted to say that I haven't failed.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:09:59.910
I didn't expect that.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.260
Chinese? What's so strange about him?

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:04.860
Let's not waste time.

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:09.150
I want you to find out for me one woman and her baby.

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:10.790
What's her name?

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:12.750
The woman's name is Gloria.

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:14.540
Is the baby a boy?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.240
You'll have to find out for yourself.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.040
Here's information about Gloria.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:25.420
The photo was taken 22 years ago.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.180
Quite a difficult task.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.980
Who said it would be...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.000
Interesting. I'll give you a chance only under two conditions.

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:36.930
I also have one condition. You're right.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.410
First, the investigation must remain a secret.

00:10:39.550 --> 00:10:41.670
And second, you must find them within two weeks.

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:43.650
This is the advance payment.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.770
With well-done work, you will receive $20,000.

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.300
What is yours?

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:54.580
My condition is to accept yours.

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:58.570
Wonderful. You can find it on this number.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.220
Some kind of test?

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.220
What are you doing?

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:25.320
The newest method for saving the paper.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:26.840
I'll be waiting for your reply.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:02.460
What's wrong with you?

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:41.520
Hey, go and take the orders.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:51.440
Hey, one Coca-Cola, please.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:56.900
Right away. For you.

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:57.940
Coffee with milk.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.180
I'll be there right away.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:01.850
Anything for you?

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:02.390
No.

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:08.680
What would you like?

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:10.260
One twenty-two and one sixteen.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:10.760
Right away.

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:14.400
Anything for the drinking master?

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:15.860
One cola.

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:16.990
One cola.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:21.400
Here are your orders.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:22.140
Nice.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:25.140
Oh, there's a lot of work.

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:29.590
Fried rice.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:30.740
No, this is too hard.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.020
Double hot dog.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:43.930
Make an order.

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:48.140
Here you are.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:52.780
Enjoy your meal.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:53.260
Thank you.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:04.860
What's going on?

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:28.260
It's so annoying. Let's go.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.620
Let's get out of here.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.760
Wait, wait!

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:37.320
What?

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.620
They're messing with my business.

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.390
Hey, if you like it, move on.

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:45.460
Come on.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.060
What's your problem?

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:47.880
Get out of here.

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:49.370
You're messing with my business.

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.260
Why don't you move, yellowhead?

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:52.880
Go away.

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.030
And again.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:58.400
Get out.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:14:59.800
Come on.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.080
The one who loses, pays for the dinner.

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:02.990
Stand up!

00:15:03.430 --> 00:15:04.190
I'm the judge.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:05.830
Ready? Start!

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:13.920
Get out of the way!

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:14.520
Faster!

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:22.490
Disappear!

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:29.710
David, where did the clowns go?

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.520
I'll talk to them.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.420
I've tried.

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:37.500
There's no point.

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:44.090
Get together, Sergei.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:44.470
We're done.

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:45.090
Why?

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:47.620
We're going to play Robin Hood.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:48.160
Faster!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.800
Come on!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.340
You

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:39.800
Mom told me not to fight. To stop here.

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.860
Didn't she tell you not to come here?

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.120
Yes, but I forgot. I'm sorry.

00:16:47.590 --> 00:16:49.690
I'm not going to fight with you. I'm leaving.

00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:53.600
Dave, let's go back to work.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:56.900
Good day.

00:16:56.940 --> 00:16:57.340
Good day.

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:58.900
Misses, if you like.

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:06.070
Bye-bye.

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:09.930
Psychiatric hospital, San Agapito.

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:12.280
When will they let your father out of here?

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:15.700
No one can imagine. You know how it is with mental illnesses.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.020
His mother, we broke her leg.

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:22.540
Eh, it's not a big deal.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:23.760
Who said it's big?

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.920
That's how it sounds to me.

00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.040
And what did you have to say?

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:29.640
You had to say, ha-ha!

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:30.580
We've got a rubber band.

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:32.940
No normal person would react like that.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:35.100
I've got a rubber band!

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:36.800
You're right.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.300
It's just the freaks who do it.

00:17:38.690 --> 00:17:39.590
Come on, change it.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:45.370
Wait, wait.

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.410
Do you have a magnet?

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:46.910
No.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:47.990
What's it for?

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:49.370
I want to tie it to a rope.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.350
What's the purpose of that?

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:53.250
So I can put it in the channel.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.030
Don't you have a problem with that?

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:55.250
Why?

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.690
What's the purpose of putting a magnet in the channel?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.820
To pull out a nut.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.550
What tires?

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:05.020
These ones?

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:06.370
Smart boy.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.980
You're right.

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:11.230
We really need a magnet.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.250
Didn't I tell you?

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:13.900
We're in trouble.

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:17.130
I can't believe it.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:19.270
How can you be so stupid, boy?

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:20.790
Do you have an idea?

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:21.700
Yes.

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:24.710
I may be a little confused, but that's easy.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.010
Lighting?

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:26.570
Yes.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.180
Take another tire from the other tires.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.060
That way you'll have three hooks for every rubber.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:36.810
This will solve your problem in time, while you take a shower at home.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:37.890
It's that simple.

00:18:39.280 --> 00:18:40.120
Yes, man!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:43.220
You're a smart man. What are you doing in the bathroom?

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:44.100
Are you crazy?

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.990
There are emotionally unstable people here, not fools.

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:50.190
These are two fundamentally different things.

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:52.840
You're really terribly stupid.

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:54.660
There's no more...

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.500
I'm going to waste my time with you.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.220
I'm going to...

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:01.300
Let's look for another beach.

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.500
Okay, let's change the band.

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:14.300
What do you think this guy is doing?

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:14.760
I don't know.

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:15.520
Ask him.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:16.230
Ask him what?

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:17.660
I'll ask him.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:20.620
Hey, what are you doing?

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:23.250
I am an alarm clock.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:25.190
I measure the time.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:26.430
What time is it?

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.150
Two and a half.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.480
You're wrong. I need the 15th.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:32.940
Oh, I'll leave it.

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:46.730
Wait, what's your father doing?

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:47.470
He's fishing.

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:54.500
Dad, we came to see you.

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:57.440
Quiet, quiet. You'll scare me.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:59.080
Since when have you been here?

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.560
Are you bored here, Chicho?

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.920
The whole world is boring.

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:09.820
Have you found a girl for David?

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.500
There aren't many Chinese girls in Spain.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:14.160
Who said she had to be Chinese?

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.500
There's no nationality for love.

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:18.240
He's changed.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.190
Now I'm worried.

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:22.890
Isn't it funny?

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:28.030
Chicho, what is he doing?

00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:29.470
He's telling jokes.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.040
How funny!

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:37.270
What happened to him now?

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:38.710
He's already heard about it.

00:20:39.490 --> 00:20:40.750
He's still thinking about Columbus.

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:45.440
Hey, how are you today?

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:46.360
Coldwelly?

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:47.670
Get one for me, too.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:50.060
I didn't know you were a mad doctor.

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:53.190
Tell me, how to catch a fish in the lake?

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:55.550
I got it done by your father.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:03.200
Oh, the bell!

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:10.450
It's time for my date.

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.540
If you want, come with me.

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:20.830
Who is this mysterious woman?

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:21.810
Do I know her?

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:24.250
Hello.

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:39.000
It's no wonder that love has no nationality.

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.540
It's no wonder that I'm getting married.

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:41.550
Where's your mother?

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:44.350
Get ready. We sent her to warn you that she'll be late.

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:48.190
Tell her not to hurry. If she has to, I'll be waiting for her all my life.

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:57.180
I know what you're thinking.

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:59.620
I know what you're suggesting, but I'm not thinking that.

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:03.840
I don't think so. I'm sure you're thinking the same, because I'm thinking the same.

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:08.330
You're saying that our brains work in one wave, right?

00:22:08.670 --> 00:22:10.770
Exactly. So the two of us have to say goodbye.

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:11.910
It's beautiful.

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:14.220
It belongs to my father.

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:15.650
Good.

00:22:15.990 --> 00:22:19.160
Well, we're off.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:20.840
See you next week.

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:24.180
Don't worry. I want you to meet my girlfriend.

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.420
Some other time.

00:22:25.780 --> 00:22:26.720
Here she is.

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:28.960
Oh, Gloria.

00:22:30.600 --> 00:22:31.540
I missed you.

00:22:32.000 --> 00:22:33.080
You look great.

00:22:33.640 --> 00:22:35.670
I'm so glad to see you.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:37.340
I know what you're thinking.

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:37.820
I'm sure.

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:39.620
Are we thinking the same thing again?

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:40.220
Let's get to work.

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:41.440
I have to go.

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:42.760
Goodbye, take care.

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:47.550
Let's tell your father we're leaving.

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:49.560
Daddy, we're leaving.

00:22:49.880 --> 00:22:50.620
Hey, wait.

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:52.420
Don't be in such a hurry.

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:53.960
Meet Gloria.

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:56.840
This is my son David and his brother Thomas.

00:22:57.260 --> 00:22:57.440
Hola.

00:22:57.520 --> 00:22:57.640
Hola.

00:22:58.820 --> 00:22:59.700
And now go.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.900
Leave it to us. Come on.

00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:06.700
Look, there's a taxi waiting.

00:23:07.110 --> 00:23:09.770
What a chance. Tell her we'll take her.

00:23:10.130 --> 00:23:11.730
And without it, the taxis are too expensive.

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:13.780
What if she likes to take a taxi?

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:15.280
Don't be silly.

00:23:15.680 --> 00:23:18.130
You talk to her. I'll take the bus.

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:19.590
Wait. I'm giving you a chance.

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:21.710
Go talk to her. Come on.

00:23:28.980 --> 00:23:29.260
Hello.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:30.340
Hello.

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:43.170
Wait, wait. Your taxi.

00:23:43.550 --> 00:23:43.930
Bye.

00:23:53.300 --> 00:23:54.700
David, did you say no?

00:23:54.960 --> 00:23:56.900
No, I didn't suggest it at all.

00:23:56.980 --> 00:23:58.060
You can't do anything about it.

00:23:58.270 --> 00:23:59.670
The result was going to be the same.

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:03.480
You talk nonsense. There's no way you know if you haven't tried.

00:24:03.840 --> 00:24:05.980
The chance to agree was 50-50.

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:10.810
She's gentle, she's beautiful, she's sweet.

00:24:11.720 --> 00:24:12.720
She's a real princess.

00:24:13.000 --> 00:24:14.420
A princess with a crazy mother.

00:24:14.740 --> 00:24:15.380
Why not?

00:24:15.630 --> 00:24:18.280
Yes, it's possible. Come on, get in.

00:24:25.430 --> 00:24:27.790
Two thousand? And your mother will cost you more.

00:24:28.050 --> 00:24:29.960
Don't be mean. I suggest...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:31.490
4,000.

00:24:32.700 --> 00:24:33.220
Good.

00:24:34.600 --> 00:24:35.740
Thomas, two coffees.

00:24:35.940 --> 00:24:37.060
We'll order later.

00:24:37.340 --> 00:24:38.080
We won't be in a hurry.

00:24:39.910 --> 00:24:42.170
Hey, don't forget to do your math.

00:24:42.610 --> 00:24:44.050
Thomas, how much do you owe?

00:24:44.310 --> 00:24:44.770
Wait.

00:24:47.660 --> 00:24:48.640
1,200.

00:24:49.330 --> 00:24:50.410
Here's 1,300.

00:24:50.650 --> 00:24:51.170
For the change.

00:24:51.650 --> 00:24:52.900
Thank you.

00:24:53.700 --> 00:24:54.720
Can I have one roll?

00:24:54.920 --> 00:24:56.380
Thank you.

00:24:56.600 --> 00:24:58.860
It costs 70-50.

00:24:59.160 --> 00:24:59.880
Big buck.

00:25:07.960 --> 00:25:15.770
What's your price?

00:25:16.310 --> 00:25:17.660
15,000.

00:25:17.740 --> 00:25:17.880
Three.

00:25:19.090 --> 00:25:20.770
Save them for your pension.

00:25:22.740 --> 00:25:23.700
Three thousand.

00:25:24.120 --> 00:25:24.560
Two.

00:25:24.920 --> 00:25:25.740
Get out of here.

00:25:25.920 --> 00:25:26.260
Hola.

00:25:27.940 --> 00:25:28.260
Hola.

00:25:37.770 --> 00:25:38.830
I saw the princess!

00:25:39.480 --> 00:25:42.630
Nonsense! What would a princess do in a place like this?

00:25:42.710 --> 00:25:44.770
If you want, go and check with your own eyes.

00:25:47.100 --> 00:25:47.980
$15,000.

00:25:49.080 --> 00:25:51.920
$100 is a reasonable offer. Come on.

00:25:54.050 --> 00:25:55.510
Look, look, here comes Sonzi.

00:25:55.830 --> 00:25:56.530
What's wrong with you?

00:25:56.570 --> 00:25:58.770
If it weren't for Gadje, what would be your problem?

00:26:00.350 --> 00:26:06.030
You've brought me so many spring rolls, that I'll let you in for free this evening.

00:26:06.230 --> 00:26:07.220
Are you coming?

00:26:08.700 --> 00:26:10.840
We're sorry, we can't.

00:26:11.240 --> 00:26:12.420
Thank you very much.

00:26:15.400 --> 00:26:17.200
I didn't expect her to be a prostitute.

00:26:17.440 --> 00:26:18.280
Don't be disappointed.

00:26:18.710 --> 00:26:20.690
At least she's not one of the cheap ones.

00:26:21.680 --> 00:26:23.020
Wait, how much money do you have?

00:26:23.200 --> 00:26:23.620
Why?

00:26:23.900 --> 00:26:24.380
Come on!

00:26:25.380 --> 00:26:27.670
20,000 and a little.

00:26:27.990 --> 00:26:29.550
What? Too much for one sex?

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:31.740
What are you talking about? I'll just give them to her.

00:26:32.200 --> 00:26:34.000
So she can go to bed tomorrow evening?

00:26:34.500 --> 00:26:35.320
Think about it.

00:26:35.320 --> 00:26:37.220
This place is full of prostitutes.

00:26:37.380 --> 00:26:39.850
We can't help all of them, can we?

00:26:39.990 --> 00:26:43.020
We can't even afford to take them out with our spring rolls.

00:26:44.470 --> 00:26:45.250
Let's get to work.

00:27:08.060 --> 00:27:09.200
He stole my wallet.

00:27:14.310 --> 00:27:18.820
Stop! Hold it! Stop!

00:27:32.240 --> 00:27:37.410
Have you seen a girl? Red dress, stole my wallet.

00:27:39.160 --> 00:27:41.520
A man should take good care of his things.

00:27:41.780 --> 00:27:45.270
What are you?

00:27:45.720 --> 00:27:47.720
You are Miss World, my name is Treska.

00:27:47.860 --> 00:27:48.740
What are we going to do?

00:27:49.630 --> 00:27:50.770
Let's clean up.

00:27:50.930 --> 00:27:53.270
At least make the last order.

00:27:53.630 --> 00:27:56.620
Thomas, have you seen a tall, skinny girl?

00:27:57.040 --> 00:27:57.740
Is that so?

00:27:57.980 --> 00:27:58.400
Yes.

00:28:00.410 --> 00:28:02.150
Oh, there's a lot of them.

00:28:02.190 --> 00:28:03.090
Are you serious?

00:28:03.590 --> 00:28:04.550
No, I'm not.

00:28:04.650 --> 00:28:05.380
And now?

00:28:05.620 --> 00:28:06.420
Let's look around.

00:28:09.110 --> 00:28:11.700
So the princess is a prostitute and a whore.

00:28:14.600 --> 00:28:16.880
The American could have lost his wallet.

00:28:17.380 --> 00:28:19.500
We shouldn't judge people by their stories.

00:28:19.960 --> 00:28:20.680
We're here.

00:28:21.200 --> 00:28:22.300
Do you think I don't know?

00:28:22.660 --> 00:28:23.640
I didn't talk to you.

00:28:24.990 --> 00:28:25.410
Hello.

00:28:25.950 --> 00:28:26.250
Hola.

00:28:28.880 --> 00:28:29.400
So...

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.540
It's strange that I'm told you're not well.

00:28:31.940 --> 00:28:34.700
Calm down, don't worry. Let's get out of here.

00:28:34.800 --> 00:28:35.530
Come on.

00:28:42.280 --> 00:28:44.360
Miss, this is the end of the journey.

00:28:44.720 --> 00:28:45.920
I want to stay with you.

00:28:46.580 --> 00:28:48.060
Make an appointment in our apartment.

00:28:49.780 --> 00:28:51.840
And don't you want to tell her that Thomas didn't come well?

00:28:53.320 --> 00:28:54.760
No, I messed up my hand.

00:28:55.740 --> 00:28:57.360
It will be a pleasure for us.

00:28:57.460 --> 00:28:58.840
Please make an appointment. After you.

00:29:00.090 --> 00:29:00.910
Thank you.

00:29:04.800 --> 00:29:06.240
Mr. Ljubovnik is at home.

00:29:11.500 --> 00:29:11.680
Hello.

00:29:12.360 --> 00:29:13.300
Here is the cap.

00:29:13.900 --> 00:29:14.620
Not at the moment.

00:29:16.180 --> 00:29:17.640
Someone close to him has died.

00:29:18.080 --> 00:29:18.460
Why?

00:29:19.020 --> 00:29:20.700
He is dressed as if he was buried.

00:29:28.290 --> 00:29:29.950
Hello. We haven't seen each other for a long time.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.020
Oh, it's you. Let's have a drink together.

00:29:35.610 --> 00:29:37.360
No, I can't today.

00:29:37.660 --> 00:29:39.100
I need to see the bottle.

00:29:39.620 --> 00:29:40.960
I'm on my way. What happened?

00:29:41.600 --> 00:29:42.800
I have to ask you something.

00:29:43.400 --> 00:29:46.900
I'm already the executive director of the MAD agency.

00:29:46.940 --> 00:29:48.550
But I don't tell anyone.

00:29:48.910 --> 00:29:50.230
What do you take me for?

00:29:50.410 --> 00:29:51.250
Let's drink to that.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.980
I'm not going to get drunk today. I can't.

00:30:07.160 --> 00:30:09.300
Moby, since when haven't we seen each other?

00:30:09.500 --> 00:30:10.680
Come on, let's drink one more.

00:30:11.970 --> 00:30:12.530
Just one.

00:30:12.930 --> 00:30:17.970
Good. Sit down. Let's drink one more.

00:30:18.680 --> 00:30:19.840
Have you seen the bottle?

00:30:20.720 --> 00:30:21.800
No, what for?

00:30:22.180 --> 00:30:25.160
Can I trust you?

00:30:25.660 --> 00:30:27.440
Well, how long have we known each other?

00:30:27.860 --> 00:30:29.680
Come on, I already know.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:32.180
I know a lot of secrets. I'll keep it to myself.

00:30:32.960 --> 00:30:37.300
Okay, listen. But don't pretend that you won't tell anyone.

00:30:37.660 --> 00:30:40.980
At the moment, I'm the executive director of the MAD agency.

00:30:41.020 --> 00:30:45.000
I want to talk to Shishko about something very important.

00:30:45.340 --> 00:30:47.140
We deserve to drink to that.

00:30:47.660 --> 00:30:49.220
Thank you very much. Cheers.

00:30:51.220 --> 00:30:52.980
Hey, did they hang Moby?

00:30:55.300 --> 00:30:58.660
I really can't drink today. I'm going to look for Shishko.

00:30:59.410 --> 00:30:59.730
Moby!

00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:01.220
My sincere congratulations!

00:31:01.560 --> 00:31:01.880
Cheers!

00:31:03.680 --> 00:31:03.860
Cheers!

00:31:06.170 --> 00:31:19.440
Please, keep my little secret to yourself.

00:31:19.740 --> 00:31:20.600
Bye-bye!

00:31:30.670 --> 00:31:31.170
Hello?

00:31:31.980 --> 00:31:32.960
Oh, honey!

00:31:33.260 --> 00:31:33.780
Moby!

00:31:35.220 --> 00:31:36.080
One kiss?

00:31:36.420 --> 00:31:40.280
How could I forget you?

00:31:40.400 --> 00:31:42.830
Well, I was very busy.

00:31:43.310 --> 00:31:47.100
I guess this is the truth.

00:31:48.680 --> 00:31:49.040
Yes.

00:31:49.400 --> 00:31:50.850
It must be a big pig.

00:31:52.240 --> 00:31:52.700
No.

00:31:53.500 --> 00:31:54.860
I really can't tonight.

00:31:55.940 --> 00:31:56.520
Okay, okay.

00:31:57.520 --> 00:31:58.100
One kiss?

00:31:58.770 --> 00:31:59.570
Wait, wait.

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:03.320
Now, did you hear me?

00:32:03.640 --> 00:32:07.080
One moment. Hey, your wife.

00:32:13.700 --> 00:32:14.400
Trust me.

00:32:15.490 --> 00:32:16.330
I'll kill you.

00:32:16.650 --> 00:32:18.670
You filthy pig. Get out.

00:32:18.730 --> 00:32:22.830
Get out, I'll beat you.

00:32:23.010 --> 00:32:24.560
Wait, wait.

00:32:24.780 --> 00:32:26.180
Wait, Susanna, calm down.

00:32:26.670 --> 00:32:27.750
Dino had a white shirt.

00:32:28.510 --> 00:32:29.710
I didn't bring you.

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:32.840
These are women's clothes. Are they mine at all?

00:32:33.540 --> 00:32:34.740
Why did you break them?

00:32:34.840 --> 00:32:35.960
I was in a hurry.

00:32:36.340 --> 00:32:39.400
I'll kill him. Let me go.

00:32:39.480 --> 00:32:42.020
Wait, wait. This is our door.

00:32:42.220 --> 00:32:42.940
I'll kill him.

00:32:43.040 --> 00:32:44.280
Don't point your weapon at our door.

00:32:44.700 --> 00:32:46.210
Let me go.

00:32:47.030 --> 00:32:48.710
Take your hands off me.

00:32:49.430 --> 00:32:52.150
You're right. Because you're afraid you won't lose him.

00:32:52.210 --> 00:32:53.190
You don't want him to die, right?

00:32:53.410 --> 00:32:55.420
You're a very common flirt for one night.

00:32:55.680 --> 00:32:58.300
But you're his wife and he loves you.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.300
I love him so much.

00:33:01.780 --> 00:33:03.320
Tell him you forgive him.

00:33:03.540 --> 00:33:10.060
Dino, Dino, answer me.

00:33:11.270 --> 00:33:14.090
Don't you know how much I love you?

00:33:14.310 --> 00:33:15.430
I love you too.

00:33:15.610 --> 00:33:17.730
Do you remember the day we met?

00:33:18.350 --> 00:33:20.310
It was love at first sight.

00:33:20.510 --> 00:33:20.950
Really?

00:33:21.390 --> 00:33:22.810
You are my whole life.

00:33:23.290 --> 00:33:24.930
I can't live without you.

00:33:26.470 --> 00:33:27.270
I can't.

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:32.030
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

00:33:32.300 --> 00:33:33.640
Wait, you coward!

00:33:36.220 --> 00:33:38.020
You shouldn't have interfered.

00:33:38.160 --> 00:33:39.720
We don't want to keep you.

00:33:40.280 --> 00:33:41.760
I'm not going out tonight.

00:33:42.240 --> 00:33:45.230
What? You have something against it?

00:33:45.730 --> 00:33:48.130
Oh, no! I thought I'd be worried.

00:33:48.610 --> 00:33:49.570
Are you the boys?

00:33:50.330 --> 00:33:55.490
Why not? What are we going to do?

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:00.560
I'm sick.

00:34:07.130 --> 00:34:11.400
Shishko! Shishko! What happened?

00:34:11.960 --> 00:34:12.980
Did they kill you today?

00:34:13.320 --> 00:34:14.780
That's all. It's none of my business.

00:34:15.570 --> 00:34:18.600
God, you're so heavy.

00:34:20.320 --> 00:34:21.460
Hey, tell me what happened.

00:34:22.960 --> 00:34:24.540
Okay, okay, I don't need to know.

00:34:25.040 --> 00:34:27.000
I want to ask you something.

00:34:27.440 --> 00:34:29.140
When you were a big smuggler, 18 years ago...

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:36.260
to get to know some Gloria, she might have been pregnant at the time, or maybe she was just about to give birth to him.

00:34:37.600 --> 00:34:38.040
Please?

00:34:38.640 --> 00:34:41.640
And those guys, have they come to you or have they asked about her?

00:34:41.800 --> 00:34:43.230
Have they told you anything?

00:34:43.820 --> 00:34:44.240
No.

00:34:45.220 --> 00:34:45.860
Well done.

00:34:46.220 --> 00:34:47.800
Otherwise I would be dead.

00:34:48.590 --> 00:34:50.450
Well, do you know where this woman is now?

00:34:51.250 --> 00:34:51.690
No.

00:34:52.500 --> 00:34:52.940
Maybe.

00:34:53.360 --> 00:34:54.940
I don't know.

00:34:55.560 --> 00:34:56.140
Come on.

00:34:56.600 --> 00:34:57.540
Explain yourself later.

00:34:57.980 --> 00:34:59.500
Tell me where she lives.

00:35:01.120 --> 00:35:04.600
The street of gratitude, 62...

00:35:04.600 --> 00:35:10.660
Aren't you afraid that...

00:35:10.660 --> 00:35:12.720
Yes, to hide the money.

00:35:14.160 --> 00:35:20.560
But if she looks for them and sees that we have hidden them, she will understand that we have taken measures and her pride will be hurt.

00:35:21.050 --> 00:35:21.530
That's right.

00:35:23.660 --> 00:35:27.880
I will leave a little money in the wallets and to steal them won't be a big deal.

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:29.400
And the rest we will hide well.

00:35:30.160 --> 00:35:30.920
Here it is.

00:35:31.000 --> 00:35:39.070
Can you think?

00:35:39.610 --> 00:35:40.070
Bravo.

00:35:58.660 --> 00:35:59.980
This is your risotto.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:00.300
Yes.

00:36:00.580 --> 00:36:01.800
It suits her better.

00:36:02.180 --> 00:36:02.750
Are you talking about me?

00:36:03.390 --> 00:36:03.910
Yes.

00:36:05.550 --> 00:36:06.550
I hope it's something nice.

00:36:07.370 --> 00:36:09.310
Super, super, super, super, super.

00:36:10.250 --> 00:36:11.730
Thank you very much.

00:36:11.890 --> 00:36:12.530
Where are you going to sleep?

00:36:13.170 --> 00:36:13.670
Here.

00:36:14.510 --> 00:36:15.660
Thank you.

00:36:15.760 --> 00:36:17.700
By the way, I'm Sylvia.

00:36:17.800 --> 00:36:18.120
David.

00:36:18.280 --> 00:36:19.040
I'm Thomas.

00:36:24.960 --> 00:36:26.460
Good night.

00:36:26.820 --> 00:36:27.820
You go to bed.

00:36:27.960 --> 00:36:29.540
If you're tired, I'll watch TV.

00:36:30.120 --> 00:36:31.320
I'll let him go now.

00:36:31.340 --> 00:36:31.980
Thank you.

00:36:46.060 --> 00:36:46.900
Good night.

00:37:07.800 --> 00:37:10.900
It will be more convenient for you with this headgear.

00:37:11.340 --> 00:37:11.820
Take it.

00:37:12.280 --> 00:37:12.520
Thank you.

00:37:12.840 --> 00:37:22.620
Shall I bring you a glass of water?

00:37:23.060 --> 00:37:23.480
Yes, please.

00:37:31.120 --> 00:37:33.460
You'll need a blanket. It's cold at night.

00:37:36.020 --> 00:37:36.940
Thank you very much.

00:37:37.320 --> 00:37:37.640
You're welcome.

00:37:40.370 --> 00:37:42.940
Listen, the milk is better than the water.

00:37:43.220 --> 00:37:43.730
Thank you.

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:00.800
Thank you.

00:38:19.410 --> 00:38:21.030
Let's not waste our time with nonsense.

00:38:21.410 --> 00:38:23.690
Which of you wants to sleep with me first?

00:38:23.940 --> 00:38:25.300
It doesn't matter to me.

00:38:30.410 --> 00:38:31.230
Hello.

00:38:38.610 --> 00:38:39.610
Good morning.

00:38:40.540 --> 00:38:42.380
Good morning. How is your wife?

00:38:42.740 --> 00:38:44.050
Good. She loves me.

00:38:44.520 --> 00:38:45.240
Thank God.

00:38:45.680 --> 00:38:50.800
Have you seen my car?

00:38:51.100 --> 00:38:51.400
No.

00:38:55.220 --> 00:38:57.340
Susanna, they stole my car.

00:38:58.070 --> 00:38:59.210
I'm going to the police.

00:39:00.030 --> 00:39:02.650
Let me make a complaint. Did you steal my car?

00:39:04.510 --> 00:39:08.390
Well, the princess left early.

00:39:08.670 --> 00:39:15.650
Well, you shouldn't judge people so easily.

00:39:16.070 --> 00:39:21.440
It doesn't hurt at all. I'm a realist.

00:39:22.110 --> 00:39:23.430
There is a little faith in humanity.

00:39:28.880 --> 00:39:29.920
Hey, the money is in my pocket.

00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:32.900
I told you, she's not that stupid.

00:39:33.660 --> 00:39:35.720
I was sure she'd kill us.

00:39:36.250 --> 00:39:38.630
To hide them in the checkmate was a stupid idea.

00:39:38.910 --> 00:39:41.190
Look at me. I hid them in my shoes.

00:39:41.650 --> 00:39:42.690
Smart, right?

00:39:48.300 --> 00:39:50.180
The devils, Svila and the others.

00:39:50.420 --> 00:39:50.940
That's right.

00:39:52.100 --> 00:39:53.840
You shouldn't have taken them from us.

00:39:54.250 --> 00:39:55.690
You should have stopped me.

00:39:56.780 --> 00:39:58.700
Anyway, she's a terrible thief.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:00.720
She left me the money.

00:40:02.170 --> 00:40:03.910
I'll thank her as soon as I see her.

00:40:04.200 --> 00:40:04.820
Me too.

00:40:05.380 --> 00:40:06.180
What are you going to do?

00:40:06.440 --> 00:40:08.100
I'm going to ask her if she can make it.

00:40:08.260 --> 00:40:22.790
Who taught you to drive?

00:40:22.990 --> 00:40:24.170
Do you have a book?

00:40:24.610 --> 00:40:26.110
I'm sorry, I'll pay you the money.

00:40:27.800 --> 00:40:28.680
This time I understand.

00:40:28.960 --> 00:40:29.220
Watch.

00:40:30.090 --> 00:40:31.350
I'm going to throw away my car.

00:40:31.890 --> 00:40:33.350
I'm going to have a car accident.

00:40:33.850 --> 00:40:35.350
Please, forgive me.

00:40:36.240 --> 00:40:37.720
You're lucky I'm a good man.

00:40:38.420 --> 00:40:40.160
But it's dangerous to drive like that.

00:40:40.360 --> 00:40:42.520
My brother always tells me to be more careful.

00:40:42.760 --> 00:40:45.780
I admit he's right. He's going to kill me.

00:40:48.000 --> 00:40:49.520
He calls himself Dino Martini.

00:40:49.560 --> 00:40:50.100
His car is his.

00:40:50.420 --> 00:40:52.280
Get him and he'll take care of everything.

00:40:53.170 --> 00:40:53.990
Okay, but...

00:40:53.990 --> 00:40:56.240
I have to go or he'll be fired.

00:40:56.800 --> 00:40:58.140
Let's meet up some other day.

00:40:58.640 --> 00:40:59.400
Okay, okay.

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:02.000
Thanks for watching!

00:41:02.332 --> 00:41:03.692
Go back, go back!

00:41:06.748 --> 00:41:07.748
C'mon, c'mon!

00:41:10.556 --> 00:41:11.276
Bye-bye!

00:41:38.920 --> 00:41:39.380
What do you want?

00:41:39.730 --> 00:41:41.590
To take you to a place.

00:41:42.010 --> 00:41:45.450
Police station?

00:41:48.980 --> 00:41:49.880
Not with the Chinese.

00:41:50.120 --> 00:41:50.900
I don't know you.

00:41:51.020 --> 00:41:52.540
Where are you taking me?

00:41:52.680 --> 00:41:54.000
To a nice place.

00:41:54.440 --> 00:41:55.120
What if I refuse?

00:41:57.620 --> 00:41:59.280
We can be rude.

00:42:02.290 --> 00:42:06.170
Let go of me! Stop! No!

00:42:47.080 --> 00:42:58.520
Quick! Hold the girl! Get out of the way!

00:43:02.780 --> 00:43:06.280
This is a good job. When will you bring it to me?

00:43:06.680 --> 00:43:07.940
First I'll ask you something.

00:43:08.520 --> 00:43:11.310
Tell me, maybe you don't trust me.

00:43:11.710 --> 00:43:14.950
After you hired me, why do you send some thugs to pick her up?

00:43:15.960 --> 00:43:17.200
What thugs?

00:43:17.820 --> 00:43:22.000
That's what I'm asking. That's why I didn't spit at you.

00:43:22.790 --> 00:43:24.330
I didn't take other people.

00:43:24.760 --> 00:43:25.480
Then what?

00:43:27.280 --> 00:43:29.970
That's none of your business. Just get the f**k out.

00:43:30.000 --> 00:43:31.280
Try not to get to Sylvia.

00:43:31.380 --> 00:43:32.180
How can I not get to her?

00:43:32.300 --> 00:43:34.920
I need to know what kind of challenges I'm facing.

00:43:35.120 --> 00:43:36.100
Otherwise, I won't let you in.

00:43:36.630 --> 00:43:37.470
Please, stop.

00:43:37.770 --> 00:43:42.110
I sincerely apologize for what happened.

00:43:42.470 --> 00:43:44.720
I really can't help you.

00:43:44.820 --> 00:43:46.940
Except with the increase in the budget.

00:43:49.270 --> 00:43:51.430
Do you need time to think?

00:43:57.320 --> 00:43:58.380
About three seconds.

00:43:58.640 --> 00:43:59.360
One, two, three.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:00.200
I continue.

00:44:02.420 --> 00:44:02.860
Wonderful.

00:44:03.900 --> 00:44:05.120
May God be with you.

00:44:05.220 --> 00:44:05.440
Thank you.

00:44:26.010 --> 00:44:27.610
Why did Moby call us here?

00:44:27.970 --> 00:44:29.430
He must have messed up again.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:32.280
It's best to say no, no matter what he wants.

00:44:36.000 --> 00:44:42.180
Hey! Sit down. Come on.

00:44:42.720 --> 00:44:44.020
We can't say no to that.

00:44:44.040 --> 00:44:47.820
Right. What would you like?

00:44:48.660 --> 00:44:50.360
Three beers and a bottle of brandy.

00:44:52.160 --> 00:44:53.460
How's work going?

00:44:54.360 --> 00:44:56.060
Well, worse than before.

00:44:57.340 --> 00:44:59.220
Did you like how we pulled the microbus?

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:01.480
No. It's worse than before.

00:45:02.770 --> 00:45:03.750
How is David's father?

00:45:04.490 --> 00:45:06.490
Don't ask. Much worse than before.

00:45:06.850 --> 00:45:08.930
Oh. I thought it couldn't be worse.

00:45:09.310 --> 00:45:11.330
Actually, there is already some progress.

00:45:12.270 --> 00:45:14.040
Great. Thank you.

00:45:16.320 --> 00:45:17.460
Let's drink for David's father.

00:45:18.340 --> 00:45:19.920
Oh, no. We won't drink.

00:45:20.220 --> 00:45:22.070
You can't refuse now. Cheers!

00:45:24.190 --> 00:45:25.290
Our number doesn't work.

00:45:25.570 --> 00:45:26.390
Let's go crazy.

00:45:31.820 --> 00:45:33.600
I'm going to ask you for a favor, boys.

00:45:33.920 --> 00:45:35.340
This morning I broke a car.

00:45:36.280 --> 00:45:39.040
It's no surprise that Susanna's dog gave birth to four puppies.

00:45:39.460 --> 00:45:42.240
What does this have to do with the accident?

00:45:42.920 --> 00:45:43.680
Explain it to me.

00:45:44.630 --> 00:45:46.430
What do we care about the accident?

00:45:50.630 --> 00:45:51.730
Just listen to me.

00:45:52.270 --> 00:45:55.570
The girl who was driving the car gave me a business card of her brother.

00:45:55.870 --> 00:45:58.320
And that doesn't bother us.

00:45:58.720 --> 00:45:59.820
But, brother, it says that...

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:02.180
She has such a sister. She claims that the car was stolen.

00:46:02.740 --> 00:46:05.560
When I described the girl to him, he said that she was your friend.

00:46:06.350 --> 00:46:08.060
That's it. Think about it.

00:46:08.240 --> 00:46:09.740
And that's not our job.

00:46:10.140 --> 00:46:10.520
True.

00:46:13.270 --> 00:46:17.050
But she left me some money for you. Here they are.

00:46:17.920 --> 00:46:19.240
Oh, look, she's returning the money.

00:46:19.870 --> 00:46:22.130
She's not returning them. She's just giving them to you.

00:46:22.800 --> 00:46:24.440
This money was stolen from us.

00:46:25.950 --> 00:46:28.470
So you are also her victims. Admit it.

00:46:30.090 --> 00:46:32.130
Okay, just don't give them back.

00:46:32.250 --> 00:46:34.470
Hey, don't be so hasty.

00:46:34.530 --> 00:46:35.990
She hasn't given me anything yet.

00:46:36.950 --> 00:46:38.290
I'm going to dance.

00:46:40.040 --> 00:46:40.920
Me too.

00:46:41.220 --> 00:46:57.380
Hey, do you know where to find her?

00:46:57.940 --> 00:46:58.600
At home.

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:01.220
Do you know the place that I visit often?

00:47:01.400 --> 00:47:02.200
Yes, the toilet.

00:47:02.600 --> 00:47:04.580
Come on, tell me something.

00:47:04.880 --> 00:47:06.460
The truth is that we don't know.

00:47:06.860 --> 00:47:10.890
Good. Okay, let's do that.

00:47:11.070 --> 00:47:13.680
Come on, tell me.

00:47:14.000 --> 00:47:15.460
It was very uneducated.

00:47:15.660 --> 00:47:17.970
Excuse me, please, tell me.

00:47:18.130 --> 00:47:20.210
Don't lie, we really don't know.

00:47:20.570 --> 00:47:22.840
Okay, I won't bother you.

00:47:37.710 --> 00:47:40.130
I thought you were my friends. I must have made a mistake.

00:47:40.550 --> 00:47:40.870
Please?

00:47:41.090 --> 00:47:43.930
You refuse to help a fellow countryman.

00:47:44.090 --> 00:47:47.810
Please, for a little help, and you don't even want to listen to me.

00:47:49.110 --> 00:47:51.910
Don't pretend you don't hear me. I know you understand me.

00:47:52.330 --> 00:47:55.810
The Spanish are not good at smelling, but they are much better than you, so you know.

00:47:56.170 --> 00:47:59.670
Speak louder. I can't hear you. The music is too high.

00:48:00.030 --> 00:48:02.940
I said the Spaniards are cowards!

00:48:08.340 --> 00:48:10.140
Sorry, I didn't mean that.

00:48:10.660 --> 00:48:11.400
Well done!

00:48:11.660 --> 00:48:12.520
Are you happy?

00:48:12.960 --> 00:48:20.480
I wonder who Sylvia is.

00:48:20.500 --> 00:48:21.040
A Spaniard.

00:48:21.600 --> 00:48:23.500
I mean, why are they looking for her?

00:48:24.360 --> 00:48:25.340
Because she's beautiful.

00:48:26.100 --> 00:48:26.580
Nonsense.

00:48:27.380 --> 00:48:28.880
She's not stupid, she's very smart.

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:30.360
You're dumb.

00:48:36.720 --> 00:48:37.120
Sylvia?

00:48:37.650 --> 00:48:38.050
David.

00:48:38.450 --> 00:48:39.770
We haven't seen each other for a long time.

00:48:40.050 --> 00:48:41.470
Actually, it's not exactly like that.

00:48:41.630 --> 00:48:44.550
Help me, they're following me.

00:48:45.990 --> 00:48:47.070
Hey, where are your manners?

00:49:08.670 --> 00:49:10.050
What happened? Ask them.

00:49:10.370 --> 00:49:14.040
The girl stole my wallet. These two are co-partners.

00:49:34.630 --> 00:49:36.580
He cheated on us again.

00:49:36.600 --> 00:49:38.820
He can't believe it.

00:49:39.160 --> 00:49:40.240
Don't forget about him.

00:49:40.710 --> 00:49:42.210
I never trusted him.

00:49:42.730 --> 00:49:44.990
He cheated on us in such an unpleasant way.

00:49:46.040 --> 00:49:46.580
Don't lose.

00:49:47.500 --> 00:49:48.060
That's you.

00:49:48.460 --> 00:49:49.360
What are you doing here?

00:49:49.560 --> 00:49:51.840
I came to thank you for saving me from prison.

00:49:53.330 --> 00:49:57.030
If we knew you were being chased because you took them, we wouldn't have done it.

00:49:57.050 --> 00:49:58.070
Not at all.

00:50:00.890 --> 00:50:01.790
Come on, tell her to stay.

00:50:02.290 --> 00:50:03.530
You said...

00:50:03.530 --> 00:50:04.270
Don't let her go.

00:50:04.330 --> 00:50:05.370
Come back.

00:50:05.650 --> 00:50:08.060
We want to ask you something.

00:50:09.290 --> 00:50:10.990
Let's sit down and talk upstairs.

00:50:11.560 --> 00:50:13.320
I thought you'd never offer.

00:50:15.320 --> 00:50:17.080
You wanted to ask her something, didn't you?

00:50:17.480 --> 00:50:19.500
I think you should talk to her.

00:50:19.680 --> 00:50:20.060
Me?

00:50:20.350 --> 00:50:20.750
Come on.

00:50:23.890 --> 00:50:24.410
What...

00:50:24.410 --> 00:50:28.320
What are you going to drink?

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:32.510
Wait, I'll bring it.

00:50:32.750 --> 00:50:33.740
Come on, do it.

00:50:37.990 --> 00:50:40.710
Last night, when I was sleeping here,

00:50:40.810 --> 00:50:42.870
this morning we found out that...

00:50:42.870 --> 00:50:48.260
that the whole room was cleaned and repaired.

00:50:48.820 --> 00:50:53.890
But we didn't have the money.

00:50:55.460 --> 00:50:56.280
And you...

00:50:56.280 --> 00:50:58.820
you didn't have the money, and...

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:00.260
We're so happy!

00:51:00.580 --> 00:51:02.840
Come on, get up. I'll ask her.

00:51:04.570 --> 00:51:07.710
David actually wants to say that you stole our money, right?

00:51:07.970 --> 00:51:08.210
That's right.

00:51:08.450 --> 00:51:10.130
Just like that guy's car.

00:51:10.870 --> 00:51:11.210
Yes.

00:51:12.160 --> 00:51:13.640
Thomas, don't be so rude.

00:51:13.840 --> 00:51:16.000
Am I rude? It's your turn.

00:51:18.120 --> 00:51:19.520
You're so beautiful.

00:51:19.880 --> 00:51:21.940
Come on, you can...

00:51:25.890 --> 00:51:29.860
He wants to say that you can...

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:33.080
I don't want you to spend all your money on prostitutes, right?

00:51:33.600 --> 00:51:40.440
Don't call me a prostitute. I don't sell my body.

00:51:40.840 --> 00:51:42.760
I don't sleep with anyone for money.

00:51:43.200 --> 00:51:45.600
Why did you hit me? I'm just a translator.

00:51:46.140 --> 00:51:47.700
If only you had hit him.

00:51:49.440 --> 00:51:51.100
And theft is a crime.

00:51:53.740 --> 00:51:57.870
I took my mom to the psychiatrist when I was 14.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:03.060
Since then, I've been taking care of myself.

00:52:03.460 --> 00:52:06.620
No one has given me a chance.

00:52:09.200 --> 00:52:13.640
All the men in my life just wanted to put me in bed.

00:52:14.000 --> 00:52:17.800
They were only interested in my body.

00:52:18.260 --> 00:52:19.940
I admit that I was also interested.

00:52:22.090 --> 00:52:23.470
I stole their money.

00:52:23.650 --> 00:52:25.780
I don't see anything wrong with that.

00:52:25.940 --> 00:52:28.290
They deserved it.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:31.520
I have one thing in mind for beautiful women.

00:52:33.060 --> 00:52:34.800
Didn't I tell you not to get involved?

00:52:35.330 --> 00:52:36.810
But you two are different.

00:52:38.190 --> 00:52:39.570
You were very nice to me.

00:52:42.100 --> 00:52:44.840
I'll give you the money as soon as I have the opportunity.

00:52:45.100 --> 00:52:45.880
I promise.

00:52:46.360 --> 00:52:48.080
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:52:48.670 --> 00:52:49.930
I'm not in a hurry.

00:52:50.460 --> 00:52:53.320
Give him his first, because he needs them for the wedding.

00:52:53.900 --> 00:52:54.380
Nonsense!

00:52:54.720 --> 00:52:55.880
Take care of them in a hurry.

00:52:56.300 --> 00:52:58.320
Oh, then give me mine first.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:02.760
It doesn't matter. I'm done with my honest work.

00:53:03.260 --> 00:53:06.380
Thomas told me that my mother and father are very close.

00:53:06.620 --> 00:53:08.660
You can't keep stealing, right?

00:53:09.780 --> 00:53:10.000
Yes.

00:53:10.790 --> 00:53:13.270
But I'm worried that he's starting to like you.

00:53:14.130 --> 00:53:16.810
No one would be a criminal if you had a different choice.

00:53:17.480 --> 00:53:19.580
What if you had a chance to start clean?

00:53:19.820 --> 00:53:20.840
I'll grab him with both hands.

00:53:21.520 --> 00:53:24.040
David, are you saying that we don't have enough staff?

00:53:24.560 --> 00:53:25.780
When did I say that?

00:53:27.120 --> 00:53:27.320
Oh!

00:53:27.480 --> 00:53:28.200
Oh, yes.

00:53:28.580 --> 00:53:29.420
Yes, yes, yes, but...

00:53:29.420 --> 00:53:29.880
Come on.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:30.920
You probably won't be able to hold on.

00:53:31.040 --> 00:53:33.200
I want to try, please. Please.

00:53:34.160 --> 00:53:37.560
Okay. You are set for a trial period.

00:54:04.060 --> 00:54:07.400
On the road, the old man walks slowly on the street

00:54:07.400 --> 00:54:09.480
I try to use all my strength to fly

00:54:09.480 --> 00:54:14.770
With all my strength and passion, I rush to the bottom of the bridge

00:54:15.130 --> 00:54:16.750
I sometimes regret

00:54:16.750 --> 00:54:24.820
Even if I'm on the road, I still have the ability to come back

00:54:24.820 --> 00:54:29.700
Even if I know everything on my face

00:54:30.990 --> 00:54:33.820
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

00:55:00.570 --> 00:55:00.830
We'll be right back.

00:55:32.400 --> 00:55:32.660
Hello.

00:55:32.920 --> 00:55:33.200
Hello.

00:55:33.720 --> 00:55:35.700
I need to talk to you.

00:55:36.480 --> 00:55:37.020
Come on.

00:55:37.690 --> 00:55:38.470
Come with me.

00:55:38.630 --> 00:55:42.700
With them?

00:55:42.860 --> 00:55:43.380
What do you want?

00:55:43.700 --> 00:55:44.870
What do you want?

00:55:45.250 --> 00:55:46.250
Just listen to me.

00:55:47.070 --> 00:55:48.110
Don't look for a portfolio.

00:55:48.820 --> 00:55:52.460
I want to meet with a man and you can help me for that.

00:55:52.680 --> 00:55:53.220
Do you agree?

00:55:53.840 --> 00:55:54.400
Tell me.

00:55:58.260 --> 00:55:58.780
Don't shout.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:02.480
I won't do anything to you. I'm a private detective.

00:56:02.940 --> 00:56:05.660
I want to meet someone. I'll be your big debtor.

00:56:05.680 --> 00:56:09.360
Trust me. I'll let you go now. You'll be a good girl.

00:56:09.530 --> 00:56:10.860
Right? Tell me.

00:56:19.800 --> 00:56:22.600
I've gotten out on the street. You can't cheat on me.

00:56:22.970 --> 00:56:23.990
Don't waste your time.

00:56:37.060 --> 00:56:37.460
Where?

00:56:49.550 --> 00:56:50.300
Over there.

00:56:51.770 --> 00:56:52.170
Miss!

00:56:52.590 --> 00:56:54.130
Don't come any closer, or you'll fall asleep.

00:57:01.450 --> 00:57:03.170
Hey, I'll tell you something important.

00:57:03.580 --> 00:57:04.800
Silvia is in great danger.

00:57:05.100 --> 00:57:05.920
The others are here again.

00:57:06.340 --> 00:57:08.000
Believe me or you will regret it.

00:57:10.110 --> 00:57:10.630
I'll take this.

00:57:10.770 --> 00:57:11.150
There.

00:57:11.800 --> 00:57:12.240
What?

00:57:12.520 --> 00:57:13.060
For today.

00:57:13.580 --> 00:57:13.880
Stop!

00:57:42.860 --> 00:57:43.480
Leave her alone!

00:57:43.560 --> 00:57:44.620
Don't come any closer!

00:57:44.840 --> 00:57:54.860
Come on!

00:58:10.140 --> 00:58:19.270
Jump inside. After them.

00:58:24.680 --> 00:58:25.880
Stop! Wait!

00:58:27.020 --> 00:58:29.280
Come on! They'll catch us!

00:58:38.540 --> 00:58:40.220
I can't take it any longer. Give it to me!

00:58:40.580 --> 00:58:41.520
Forget it! Go back!

00:58:42.020 --> 00:58:51.510
Come on! Back, back! Faster!

00:58:51.830 --> 00:58:52.850
Come on, come on, come on, come on!

00:59:15.670 --> 00:59:17.710
You've lost your mind today.

00:59:18.390 --> 00:59:20.010
It's good that I ride a sports car.

00:59:20.900 --> 00:59:22.440
Watch more next time.

00:59:34.730 --> 00:59:36.050
To the back of the street, on the ramp!

00:59:36.330 --> 00:59:37.230
Take care!

00:59:57.830 --> 00:59:59.430
Bravo! I don't see them behind us.

01:00:00.120 --> 01:00:07.860
That's because they're in front. Let's see who he gets close to.

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:03.170
Excuse me. It's time to try the weapon.

01:01:04.100 --> 01:01:06.320
Ready? Aim. Fire!

01:01:08.270 --> 01:01:13.410
Besides, this is funny. A bit of zectine.

01:01:14.710 --> 01:01:24.550
Do you want a start?

01:01:31.692 --> 01:01:32.852
Don't worry, I'll take care of it.

01:02:00.540 --> 01:02:01.460
Hey, are you okay?

01:02:01.900 --> 01:02:03.080
We couldn't have been better!

01:02:16.980 --> 01:02:21.500
You fools, you can't kidnap a girl.

01:02:22.560 --> 01:02:24.280
There's only one possible explanation.

01:02:33.200 --> 01:02:35.610
You are completely useless.

01:02:36.190 --> 01:02:39.920
You have spent six of the fourteen days I have.

01:02:40.850 --> 01:02:42.810
God has created the world for six days.

01:02:44.350 --> 01:02:46.410
Eight days should be sufficient for us.

01:02:46.510 --> 01:02:52.980
It depends on whether I will inherit the wealth of the Count.

01:02:53.330 --> 01:02:54.370
I count on you.

01:03:02.120 --> 01:03:03.000
These men.

01:03:03.400 --> 01:03:05.750
You first.

01:03:07.140 --> 01:03:08.800
Who the hell are these people?

01:03:09.700 --> 01:03:10.340
Your turn.

01:03:10.890 --> 01:03:12.050
Read my thoughts.

01:03:12.590 --> 01:03:13.970
They won't attack me for the first time.

01:03:14.210 --> 01:03:14.450
Exactly.

01:03:17.900 --> 01:03:19.460
Mobi, don't shake us.

01:03:19.680 --> 01:03:21.460
If there is courage, you could be dead.

01:03:21.720 --> 01:03:22.440
I was about to say.

01:03:23.550 --> 01:03:26.210
They won't give up chasing Sylvia.

01:03:26.330 --> 01:03:28.470
They will try again and again until they touch her.

01:03:28.630 --> 01:03:29.770
Who are these people?

01:03:30.030 --> 01:03:30.730
The bad guys.

01:03:31.080 --> 01:03:31.880
How do you know?

01:03:32.820 --> 01:03:34.160
Because I'm one of the good guys.

01:03:34.420 --> 01:03:35.660
Tell us exactly what happened.

01:03:36.190 --> 01:03:38.990
Oh, this is just a story that's a bit more complicated.

01:03:39.490 --> 01:03:40.730
We have two sides.

01:03:40.890 --> 01:03:42.220
Those guys and me.

01:03:43.180 --> 01:03:46.500
Officially, I deal with Sylvia.

01:03:46.540 --> 01:03:48.970
And those guys are trying to distract her.

01:03:49.070 --> 01:03:51.270
I want to deliver Sylvia to my client.

01:03:51.730 --> 01:03:55.290
But I have no idea why they want to distract her.

01:03:55.780 --> 01:03:57.820
I'm starting to get confused.

01:03:58.140 --> 01:03:59.470
It would be better if you didn't explain.

01:04:00.640 --> 01:04:02.980
But at least you know what your client wants from me.

01:04:03.260 --> 01:04:04.880
Yes, that would be normal.

01:04:05.320 --> 01:04:08.120
But since he didn't tell me, I really don't know.

01:04:08.280 --> 01:04:08.900
I'm sorry.

01:04:10.020 --> 01:04:10.580
That's it.

01:04:12.070 --> 01:04:14.590
Moby, say one thing you know for sure.

01:04:15.090 --> 01:04:16.290
I'll tell you two.

01:04:16.700 --> 01:04:18.680
First, this place is dangerous.

01:04:19.880 --> 01:04:20.940
Do you smell like gas?

01:04:21.100 --> 01:04:23.560
No, but you can trust me.

01:04:23.760 --> 01:04:28.380
Second, if Sylvia comes with me, she'll know what my client wants from her.

01:04:28.960 --> 01:04:29.400
Oh.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:31.060
I know something, too.

01:04:31.120 --> 01:04:31.560
What is it?

01:04:31.860 --> 01:04:34.620
The most stupid private detective around.

01:04:36.000 --> 01:04:38.540
Don't talk to me like that. You're offending me.

01:04:38.970 --> 01:04:42.470
We don't want to offend you, but how long have you been a private detective?

01:04:43.810 --> 01:04:44.450
Six days.

01:04:44.750 --> 01:04:47.060
What? Not even a week, right?

01:04:47.890 --> 01:04:51.350
We'll be fools if we trust you. Am I right?

01:04:52.850 --> 01:04:57.950
Enough. I can't listen to you anymore. You broke my heart.

01:05:10.670 --> 01:05:13.790
Moby, don't let them in. I'll go out through the balcony.

01:05:14.780 --> 01:05:16.400
Faster! Don't let them in!

01:05:20.220 --> 01:05:24.410
Come on, get in!

01:05:24.490 --> 01:05:24.570
Moby!

01:05:31.400 --> 01:05:31.640
Faster!

01:05:41.980 --> 01:05:43.140
Hey, why are we leaving?

01:05:43.880 --> 01:05:45.100
They're trying to distract Sylvia.

01:05:45.220 --> 01:05:46.380
There's nothing else we can do.

01:05:46.880 --> 01:05:47.720
Should we save them?

01:05:48.370 --> 01:05:48.630
They're six!

01:05:49.110 --> 01:05:52.000
We're used to fighting with a lot more at once.

01:05:52.140 --> 01:05:52.940
No, it's time for brawls.

01:05:56.300 --> 01:05:57.900
Mradni, now we'll show you.

01:05:58.020 --> 01:05:58.720
Watch out for Sylvia.

01:05:58.860 --> 01:05:59.530
Come on.

01:06:03.320 --> 01:06:03.640
HUT!

01:06:04.000 --> 01:06:04.360
Stop!

01:06:18.280 --> 01:06:18.420
Hm.

01:06:19.690 --> 01:06:19.810
Hm.

01:06:32.240 --> 01:06:43.530
They are very healthy.

01:06:43.690 --> 01:06:44.130
Let's run!

01:06:57.120 --> 01:06:58.080
What is this place?

01:06:59.150 --> 01:06:59.850
Some kind of dump.

01:07:00.730 --> 01:07:01.950
There's no way out. Let's go back.

01:07:07.740 --> 01:07:09.120
What are we going to do now?

01:07:09.300 --> 01:07:10.020
Let's hide somewhere.

01:07:10.400 --> 01:07:27.640
Does anyone have a flashlight?

01:07:28.240 --> 01:07:28.520
I do.

01:07:37.160 --> 01:07:38.080
Childish toy.

01:07:41.730 --> 01:07:42.990
Look carefully.

01:08:04.120 --> 01:08:04.820
It stinks here.

01:08:04.820 --> 01:08:07.200
I know. Wait a little longer.

01:08:22.700 --> 01:08:24.340
Hey, there's no one here.

01:08:25.920 --> 01:08:27.760
I saw them coming in here.

01:08:27.920 --> 01:08:28.800
Go on.

01:08:31.310 --> 01:08:47.540
What's better?

01:08:47.980 --> 01:08:51.340
I can't take it anymore.

01:08:51.700 --> 01:08:53.220
Wait a little longer or we're dead.

01:08:53.540 --> 01:08:59.060
I can't stand this stench anymore.

01:08:59.080 --> 01:08:59.980
What the f...

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:00.240
You're an idiot!

01:09:01.020 --> 01:09:02.440
You always get everything wrong.

01:09:02.860 --> 01:09:03.260
Run!

01:09:04.650 --> 01:09:07.270
Hey, hold on!

01:09:07.390 --> 01:09:08.260
There's something for everyone!

01:09:09.490 --> 01:09:19.340
Here you go.

01:09:19.600 --> 01:09:20.100
Scream!

01:09:21.910 --> 01:09:22.410
Scream!

01:09:22.870 --> 01:09:26.800
You've barely made it far.

01:10:12.280 --> 01:10:14.840
What do you want from me? I'm a shorty.

01:10:15.140 --> 01:10:17.000
We're glad to hear that.

01:10:17.120 --> 01:10:18.160
What can I do for you?

01:10:18.400 --> 01:10:20.060
Let us throw you out of here.

01:10:20.420 --> 01:10:20.760
Come on.

01:10:21.690 --> 01:10:22.410
Wait, wait.

01:10:22.710 --> 01:10:24.040
Have you messed with the man?

01:10:24.320 --> 01:10:25.120
No, we haven't.

01:10:25.180 --> 01:10:25.880
Who's Nell?

01:10:25.980 --> 01:10:26.260
Me.

01:10:28.250 --> 01:10:29.640
Oh, Sylvia.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:32.420
You told me to distract him. That's why I want you to die.

01:10:33.370 --> 01:10:34.210
Kick him out.

01:10:34.970 --> 01:10:38.430
Don't! No! No! Help! Help!

01:10:39.090 --> 01:10:40.590
Don't! Don't!

01:10:41.160 --> 01:10:44.000
Hear me out! I'm a father!

01:10:44.900 --> 01:10:45.620
He's your father.

01:10:48.630 --> 01:10:49.570
You're my father?

01:10:50.430 --> 01:10:53.830
No, actually, I'm your father's economist.

01:10:54.370 --> 01:10:56.990
You'll have to tell me the whole story.

01:10:59.020 --> 01:10:59.960
Your father is a...

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:03.060
The Count Lobas. Gloria was working in his palace.

01:11:03.900 --> 01:11:08.880
One night, while the countess was gone, the count raped her and she forgot about me.

01:11:09.280 --> 01:11:14.110
When he found out, the count threw her out on the street.

01:11:14.390 --> 01:11:15.780
Son of a bitch!

01:11:16.260 --> 01:11:18.080
Wait, you're still her father?

01:11:19.150 --> 01:11:20.570
I hate him. I don't want to know.

01:11:22.190 --> 01:11:23.870
Don't worry. He's dead.

01:11:25.940 --> 01:11:28.860
Before his death, he ordered me to find you and your mother.

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:32.560
I didn't want my brother Mondale to get the inheritance.

01:11:32.900 --> 01:11:36.560
I didn't mention it earlier so I wouldn't put you in danger.

01:11:37.220 --> 01:11:40.480
That's exactly why I didn't have a full-fledged private detective.

01:11:41.530 --> 01:11:43.940
It's good that Moby isn't here.

01:11:44.180 --> 01:11:45.240
Of course I am.

01:11:45.480 --> 01:11:48.220
I would really like to appear at the most inappropriate moment

01:11:48.220 --> 01:11:50.940
and hear things that I shouldn't have heard.

01:11:52.170 --> 01:11:53.950
I'm clearly not the right person.

01:11:55.280 --> 01:11:59.140
Gloria and Sylvia have to appear within 14 days after their deaths

01:11:59.140 --> 01:11:59.540
Thank you for watching this video.

01:12:01.680 --> 01:12:03.640
or Mandala gets everything.

01:12:04.210 --> 01:12:06.590
Sylvia's pursuers must be his men.

01:12:06.670 --> 01:12:08.620
There are three days left.

01:12:08.620 --> 01:12:11.270
Hey, where did you go?

01:12:11.490 --> 01:12:13.670
We helped Sylvia because she looked helpless.

01:12:14.070 --> 01:12:16.310
But now it turns out that she is the daughter of a rich count.

01:12:16.550 --> 01:12:17.890
There is no need for us.

01:12:22.200 --> 01:12:26.060
You want to say that if Sylvia was an unhappy cheater,

01:12:26.100 --> 01:12:27.880
she would be good enough for you.

01:12:28.020 --> 01:12:29.700
But if she is a daughter of a rich count,

01:12:29.700 --> 01:12:29.980
But if she is a daughter of a rich count,

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:33.260
Anna Graf is no longer at your level, is she?

01:12:33.600 --> 01:12:35.120
We just wanted to help her.

01:12:35.480 --> 01:12:37.720
But now she needs help more than ever.

01:12:38.530 --> 01:12:40.330
Don't you want to start a better life?

01:12:40.810 --> 01:12:44.320
Of course. But this is your job.

01:12:44.620 --> 01:12:47.680
I'm not Superman. You've seen the people on Mondale.

01:12:47.780 --> 01:12:50.010
They won't give up for sure.

01:12:50.090 --> 01:12:54.160
If you're Sylvia's true friends, you won't leave her right now.

01:12:55.240 --> 01:12:57.530
Enough, enough. Stop making fun of us.

01:12:57.630 --> 01:12:58.230
We're ashamed without it.

01:13:00.060 --> 01:13:01.920
Let's think of a way to help her mother.

01:13:02.200 --> 01:13:06.310
What? What are you talking about?

01:13:06.490 --> 01:13:08.400
Tell me! What do you want?

01:13:10.540 --> 01:13:16.260
Stay away! Don't come near me!

01:13:17.190 --> 01:13:19.210
I'll kill you! Get out of here!

01:13:22.380 --> 01:13:23.520
Hold him! Follow him!

01:13:25.310 --> 01:13:27.730
Let me go! Hey! Let me go!

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:32.760
Don't tie me up! Leave me alone! No! No!

01:13:33.470 --> 01:13:33.730
Done.

01:13:39.130 --> 01:13:41.400
Come on, let's finish this.

01:13:41.540 --> 01:13:43.810
It's risky. They might expose us.

01:13:43.950 --> 01:13:44.590
Play your part.

01:14:05.270 --> 01:14:07.550
Mano and David's father are dancing in the garden.

01:14:14.520 --> 01:14:15.000
What's going on?

01:14:15.020 --> 01:14:15.940
Your father is dancing over there.

01:14:32.890 --> 01:14:34.830
Mlyaska, are you trying to say something?

01:14:35.720 --> 01:14:37.240
I don't like riddles.

01:14:39.660 --> 01:14:41.200
I'm not crazy, I'm completely normal.

01:14:41.680 --> 01:14:43.450
Please, untie me.

01:14:43.650 --> 01:14:44.730
Normal like us?

01:14:45.670 --> 01:14:46.130
Of course.

01:14:46.510 --> 01:14:47.790
Ask him a few questions.

01:14:50.110 --> 01:14:53.570
Three worms are arranged in a row, one behind the other.

01:14:53.810 --> 01:14:57.330
The first worm says that there are two worms behind him.

01:14:57.490 --> 01:14:59.520
The last one says that there are two worms in front of him.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:04.420
Two worms. And the middle worm claims that there is no one around him.

01:15:04.500 --> 01:15:07.500
Do you know why he says that?

01:15:08.350 --> 01:15:09.110
Because he is blind.

01:15:09.550 --> 01:15:10.070
Wrong.

01:15:12.400 --> 01:15:13.220
I have no idea.

01:15:13.580 --> 01:15:15.360
But this mystery is very difficult.

01:15:17.420 --> 01:15:17.980
Really?

01:15:19.100 --> 01:15:19.920
Very clear.

01:15:21.400 --> 01:15:25.280
Come on, you tell me why the middle worm claims that there is no one around him.

01:15:25.760 --> 01:15:26.500
Very simple.

01:15:26.880 --> 01:15:27.760
Because he is lying.

01:15:28.950 --> 01:15:29.450
Nonsense.

01:15:30.090 --> 01:15:30.830
The worms are lying.

01:15:32.010 --> 01:15:34.210
Hey, Yannick, who tied you up like that?

01:15:36.320 --> 01:15:37.120
That's a secret.

01:15:37.750 --> 01:15:39.810
Come closer and I'll tell you by ear.

01:15:41.760 --> 01:15:45.510
And don't tell anyone else.

01:15:45.590 --> 01:15:45.970
Did you hear?

01:15:47.430 --> 01:15:49.430
That's why I had to go crazy.

01:15:51.060 --> 01:15:52.100
What did you whisper?

01:15:52.300 --> 01:15:53.640
Don't tell anyone else.

01:15:54.850 --> 01:15:55.710
I'm your friend.

01:15:56.030 --> 01:15:56.770
You're lying.

01:15:57.630 --> 01:15:58.710
But I already told you.

01:16:00.540 --> 01:16:01.180
Say it!

01:16:01.330 --> 01:16:03.290
Stop whining! I'll call them!

01:16:08.770 --> 01:16:10.330
Wait! Wait! Wait!

01:16:11.160 --> 01:16:12.880
Now there's no more whining!

01:16:13.460 --> 01:16:20.250
Hey, fool! What did he say to his ear?

01:16:20.470 --> 01:16:21.590
Why should I tell you?

01:16:21.910 --> 01:16:23.510
If you tell me, I'll untie you!

01:16:23.850 --> 01:16:25.580
Really? I don't believe you!

01:16:25.660 --> 01:16:26.360
Are you going to untie me?

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:30.900
You promised to tell me.

01:16:32.270 --> 01:16:34.810
We told him not to tell anyone else.

01:16:34.950 --> 01:16:35.510
Got it?

01:16:41.050 --> 01:16:42.270
What's there to say?

01:16:45.830 --> 01:16:48.310
Look at the beauty around us.

01:16:48.510 --> 01:16:56.510
What are you waiting for? Let's go.

01:16:56.770 --> 01:16:56.930
Where?

01:16:57.820 --> 01:16:59.600
Mom and Chuchan don't want to leave.

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:11.010
Tell them that you plan to marry Sylvia.

01:17:11.070 --> 01:17:12.730
I can't let them miss the wedding.

01:17:13.010 --> 01:17:15.580
We can't lie to your father about such a thing.

01:17:15.760 --> 01:17:18.640
You're right, but we need to show some tenderness.

01:17:20.220 --> 01:17:21.520
Come on, talk to him.

01:17:21.960 --> 01:17:25.060
Leave it to me.

01:17:25.120 --> 01:17:25.340
Bye.

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:32.460
Why didn't the two of you get married?

01:17:35.260 --> 01:17:38.390
That's right. Why didn't I think of that sooner?

01:17:38.690 --> 01:17:39.450
So you wouldn't get divorced.

01:17:39.880 --> 01:17:40.340
Are you kidding?

01:17:40.740 --> 01:17:41.140
Me?

01:17:42.190 --> 01:17:42.710
No.

01:17:43.890 --> 01:17:45.430
Why? Nobody's against it.

01:17:46.640 --> 01:17:49.090
Gloria, will you marry me?

01:17:50.020 --> 01:17:52.430
I thought you wouldn't ask. Of course.

01:17:56.490 --> 01:17:57.050
Congratulations.

01:17:59.490 --> 01:17:59.970
Thank you.

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:01.480
Are you crazy? You're already our family.

01:18:03.570 --> 01:18:05.270
Why don't you say anything, David?

01:18:05.810 --> 01:18:06.810
Call him Batko.

01:18:07.990 --> 01:18:08.530
Batko.

01:18:12.930 --> 01:18:14.840
Every problem has a solution.

01:18:15.900 --> 01:18:17.840
Just get rid of your legal father.

01:18:18.220 --> 01:18:19.680
Great idea, isn't it?

01:18:20.640 --> 01:18:24.800
See you later.

01:18:31.310 --> 01:18:32.850
What is this monster doing here?

01:18:32.970 --> 01:18:34.540
I don't know. You tell me.

01:18:35.550 --> 01:18:36.410
What are we going to do?

01:18:36.850 --> 01:18:40.130
Press the button, release the handbrake and press the button?

01:18:40.470 --> 01:18:41.810
Or are you going to go and check?

01:18:43.300 --> 01:18:45.400
You can just ask me, you fool.

01:18:56.500 --> 01:18:57.140
What is it?

01:18:59.180 --> 01:18:59.700
It's nothing.

01:19:00.000 --> 01:19:01.680
You can't do it alone, can you?

01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:30.500
Are you okay?

01:19:31.080 --> 01:19:31.900
Not really.

01:19:39.730 --> 01:19:40.590
Don't hit my son!

01:20:12.700 --> 01:20:13.600
Get rid of the bulldozer!

01:20:13.740 --> 01:20:21.730
Come on, give it back!

01:20:22.090 --> 01:20:23.080
I don't have a key!

01:20:23.400 --> 01:20:24.120
Then throw it away!

01:20:24.940 --> 01:20:26.160
Why don't you do it?

01:20:28.650 --> 01:20:28.990
Try it!

01:20:31.430 --> 01:20:44.860
We have to get into the castle, which is not difficult.

01:20:45.200 --> 01:20:47.450
It's hard to do it unnoticed.

01:20:47.650 --> 01:20:53.530
Come on, I know at least seven ways to get in.

